      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-caldas-1-peso-1919/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Colombia catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Mortgage Certificate &middot; Specimen &middot; Manizales, Colombia &middot; 1919</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">El Banco de Caldas</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">One Legal Gold Peso &middot; Mortgage Section</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"colombia-banco-de-caldas-1-peso\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-caldas-1-peso-1919-specimen-640.webp 640w, /uploads/colombia-banco-de-caldas-1-peso-1919-specimen.webp 564w\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-caldas-1-peso-1919-specimen.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Cédula hipotecaria especimen de One Legal Gold Peso de El Banco de Caldas, Manizales, obverse above and reverse below\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"590\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Colombia (Department of Caldas)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco de Caldas, Manizales &mdash; Mortgage Section</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">One Legal Gold Peso</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Type of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Cédula Hipotecaria &mdash; bond guaranteed by the active credits of the Mortgage Section of the bank. Exemplary<strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">SPECIMEN</strong>(not legal tender), numbered in zeros</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Legal Framework</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Mortgage Section established by contract with the Government of the Republic of Colombia under Law 24 of 1905</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Year</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">c. 1919</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">American Bank Note Company</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick #326 (specimen)</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"colombia-banco-de-caldas-1-peso\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-caldas-1-peso-1919-specimen.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-caldas-1-peso-1919-specimen.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Cédula hipotecaria especimen de One Legal Gold Peso de El Banco de Caldas, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colombian mortgage banking:</strong>after the collapse of Banco Nacional and the hyperinflation of the Thousand Days' War, Law 24 of 1905 allowed private banks to establish mortgage sections authorized to issue certificates backed by active loans secured by real estate &mdash;an agricultural and property-financing mechanism that flourished during the region's coffee boom.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Manizales and the department of Caldas:</strong>Founded only in 1849 by Antioquia settlers, Manizales was consolidated at the beginning of the 20th century as the financial center of the new and prosperous coffee region of the department of Caldas (created in 1905). Banco de Caldas was one of three banking entities that issued banknotes and mortgage certificates in the city, along with Banco del Ruiz and Banco Industrial de Manizales.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The bank in figures:</strong>Banco de Caldas was founded in 1915 with a subscribed capital of 200,000 gold pesos, at a time when Bogotá and Medellín concentrated more than 70% of the country's banking capital.<sup style=\"font-size:13px;\"><a href=\"#fuente-caldas\" style=\"color:#6b521f; text-decoration:none;\">[1]</a></sup>.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">An archive copy:</strong>The word &ldquo;SPECIMEN&rdquo; superimposed in red and the serial numbering in zeros (&ldquo;000000&rdquo;) identify this piece as a sample specimen, printed by the engraving house for approval or archiving &mdash;never put into circulation&mdash;, which explains its extraordinary state of preservation.</p>\n            <p id=\"fuente-caldas\" style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic; margin:24px 0 0;\">Source: Meisel-Roca, Adolfo.<a href=\"https://www.banrep.gov.co/es/chee-37\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">&ldquo;Background of the Banco de la República, 1904&ndash;1922&rdquo;<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>, Cuadernos de Historia Económica n.&deg; 37, Banco de la República &mdash; Sucursal Cartagena.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Left center portrait:</strong>bust of Francisco José de Caldas with frock coat and bowtie, inside an engraved oval &mdash;a commemorative portrait typical of Colombian banking iconography of the time.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Text of the obligation:</strong>&ldquo;Will pay the bearer, under the conditions stated on the reverse, the sum of ONE LEGAL GOLD PESO, at five percent annual interest; interest will be paid on July 31 of each year&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Place of issue:</strong>&ldquo;The principal will be paid on the ___ day of 19___ &mdash; Manizales (Colombia)&rdquo;, with the signature lines blank for &ldquo;The Manager&rdquo; and &ldquo;The Secretary&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>complete printing in green ink with highly complex guilloché, headed by &ldquo;BANCO DE CALDAS&rdquo; and the conditions of the certificate: the capital and interest are guaranteed by the active credits for loans with mortgage guarantee, and by the bank's capital allocated to this section.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Additional Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">The mortgage bonds of the Banco de Caldas were issued in six denominations (50 centavos, 1, 2, 5, 10 and 20 pesos), reflecting the relatively modest scale of a regional coffee bank. Unlike current bearer bills, these bonds accrued interest and functioned as an investment instrument backed by real estate &mdash;a direct antecedent of modern mortgage bonds, and a key piece to understand the economic boom of the Colombian coffee region at the beginning of the 20th century.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); padding-top:24px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>No Pick number confirmed in the sources consulted; cataloged in numismatic literature as a mortgage certificate from Caldas's free-banking era.</li>\n              <li>Meisel Roca, Adolfo. &ldquo;Commercial banks in the era of free banking, 1871&ndash;1923.&rdquo; In<em>Banco de la República: background, evolution and structure</em>, Banco de la República, 1990.</li>\n              <li>Heritage Auctions —<a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "El Banco de Caldas",
      "eyebrow": "Cédula Hipotecaria · Especimen · Manizales, Colombia · 1919"
